          "path": "_m/c/3/n/f/calgary-stampede-history-wk/rodeo-bucking-saddle-bronc-148.jpg",
          "filename": "Rodeo Bucking Saddle Bronc (14822564670).jpg",
          "caption": "Great time at the Calgary Stampede as always. Putting the diminutive Olympus m.zuiko 40-150mm to the test. I'm quite impressed by the level of sharpness and focus speed when coupled with the Olympus OM-D E-M5. Compares VERY favorably against my older Olympus E-3 w/ 50-200mm setup. Might just be time soon to let that setup go and switch over fully to the E-M5. I was seated towards the top of the first level, getting 300mm EFL out of a lens that size with excellent image quality is absolutely amazing.",
          "alt": "Great time at the Calgary Stampede as always. Putting the diminutive Olympus m.zuiko 40-150mm to the test. I'm quite impressed by the level of sharpness and focus speed when coupled with the Olympus OM-D E-M5. Compares VERY favorably against my older Olympus E-3 w/ 50-200mm setup. Might just be time soon to let that setup go and switch over fully to the E-M5. I was seated towards the top of the first level, getting 300mm EFL out of a lens that size with excellent image quality is absolutely amazing.",
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Wilson Hui from Calgary, Canada",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rodeo_Bucking_Saddle_Bronc_(14822564670).jpg",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
          "sourceArticleId": "calgary-stampede-history-wk",
          "sourceGeohash4": "c3nf",
          "accessedAt": "2026-02-22T02:15:47.893Z",
